# Expo Router

## Route files

- `src/app/index.tsx` — home route
- `src/app/<name>/index.tsx` — nested route
- `src/app/_layout.tsx` — root providers and layout only

## Route components stay thin

```tsx
// Bad — fetch and Redux in route file
export default function ProfileRoute() {
  const dispatch = useAppDispatch();
  useEffect(() => { dispatch(fetchProfile()); }, [dispatch]);
  return <ProfileView />;
}

// Good — route composes screen component
export default function ProfileRoute(): React.ReactElement {
  return <ProfileScreen />;
}
```

Put providers (Redux, QueryClient, SafeArea) in `_layout.tsx`, not individual routes.
